#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/
**/.gradle/
**/build/
/android/app/debug/
/android/app/profile/
/android/app/release/
